e testing runs only the namespaces that target the\n955:`gen:antlr` (the quick `test:cljs`/`test:cljd` tasks) in the SAME worktree at the\n985:   write its findings artifact — the same brief form as any delegate dispatch\n{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a1f988-e9dc-75b3-adff-847824c691c5\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"I’ll read the repository rules and the Lane B and P1c handoffs, then create the requested worktree and verify the five launch paths there.\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_1\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat docs/design/datom.world.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_1\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat docs/design/datom.world.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"---\\ndescription: Core philos","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
