{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'clj-yin-repl|jolt-yin-repl|target/yin-repl.js|build/yin-repl-peer|yin-repl-native' README.md deps.edn src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md && sed -n '1,55p;250,286p' bb.edn && cat mise.toml && rg -n 'jolt-env|BOOTSTRAP_TEST|defn|GAMBIT' src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\"","aggregated_output":"deps.edn:86:           :clj-yin-repl {:main-opts [\"-m\" \"yin.shell.main\"]}\ndeps.edn:97:           :jolt-yin-repl {:main-opts [\"-m\" \"yin.shell.main\"]}\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:22:clj -M:clj-yin-repl\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:30:node target/yin-repl.js --index-store mem\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:49:jolt -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-yin-repl --index-store mem\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:62:clj -M:clj-yin-repl\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:71:clj -M:clj-yin-repl --index-store file:/tmp/my-repl-store\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:78:clj -M:clj-yin-repl --port 8080 --headless\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:101:  node target/yin-repl.js --port 8080 --headless\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:147:   clj -M:clj-yin-repl dht serve --name b  --listen 4002 --peer localhost:4001\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:148:   clj -M:clj-yin-repl dht serve --name b2 --listen 4003 --peer localhost:4001\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:154:   clj -M:clj-yin-repl dht init --name a --listen 4001 \\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:173:   clj -M:clj-yin-repl dht join --name c yin:127.0.0.1:4001/9d61b19d...\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:189:A node remembers its startup flags in `~/.yin/<name>/state.edn` (`--name`, default `node`; or `--dir` to specify a directory directly). A bare `clj -M:clj-yin-repl --name b` resumes that node:\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:192:clj -M:clj-yin-repl dht serve --name b --listen 4002 --peer localhost:4001  # saved\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:193:clj -M:clj-yin-repl --name b                                                 # resumes it\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:194:clj -M:clj-yin-repl --name b --dht-peer 127.0.0.1:4003                       # updates peer & saves\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:208:Run `clj -M:clj-yin-repl --help` (or `-h`) on any host for the full help text.\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:255:- **Operational notes:** Keep key files outside `/tmp` and never delete a node's directory. Closing a node discards its unacknowledged retry queue. For Node process tests (`test/yin/repl/dht_process_test.clj`), build `target/yin-repl.js` with `bb build:yin-repl-node`.\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/yin.repl.md:264:- **`yin.shell.main`**: Outer host entry point that bundles the engine host driver with composition hooks (`deps.edn`'s `:clj-yin-repl`, shadow-cljs `:yin-repl`, and ClojureDart).\nREADME.md:114:mise exec -- clj -M:clj-yin-repl\n{:tasks\n {gen:antlr\n  {:doc \"Generate the pinned grammars-v4 parsers for every target (antlr/*/manifest.edn): Java compiled into build/antlr/<g>/classes, JavaScript in build/antlr/<g>/js, Dart in lib/antlr/<g>; filters after --: --grammar g --target t\"\n   :task (apply shell \"bb\" \"src/dev/build_cache.clj\"\n                \"antlr\" *command-line-args*)}\n\n  autobahn:jolt\n  {:doc \"J6f Autobahn conformance: starts the testee and the Dockerized pinned suite, waits for the READY barrier, runs harness.py per role, collects results/, and shuts both sides down. Usage: bb autobahn:jolt <role> <agent>\"\n   :task (apply shell {:continue true} \"bash\" \"tools/jolt-autobahn/launch.sh\" *command-line-args*)}\n\n  deps:npm\n  {:doc \"Worktree-local npm ci, reused only while input and installed-file digests match\"\n   :task (shell \"bb\" \"src/dev/build_cache.clj\" \"npm\")}\n\n  ;; jolt host lane (experimental, docs/design/yin.repl-jolt-implementation.md)\n  bootstrap:jolt\n  {:doc \"Materialize the jolt-toolchain.edn pins into build/tools/jolt (mise Chez/CMake checked, jolt cloned at the full SHA, never pulled) and write build/tools/jolt-env.sh\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\")))}\n\n  test:jolt-bootstrap-neg\n  {:doc \"Copy/revert the jolt clone under gitignored build/bootstrap-neg (deleted on success, retained on failure) and declare a synthetic patch and prove bootstrap refuses it unapplied or corrupted, then accepts it applied (JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR selects the source clone)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\" \"--test-negative\")))}\n\n  smoke:jolt\n  {:doc \"J0a baseline smoke under jolt -Srepro -M:jolt: tracked load of yang.antlr.export/packet and defcfn :blocking calls (needs bb bootstrap:jolt; Lane B: --target chez|gambit, the child reports jolt-target and the driver asserts it fail-closed — the gambit child runs the same smoke form under $JOLT_GAMBIT)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"-cp\" \"src/dev\"\n                         \"src/dev/jolt_target_run.clj\" \"--script\" \"src/dev/jolt_smoke.clj\" \"--\"\n                         *command-line-args*)))}\n\n  jolt\n  {:doc \"Run jolt -Srepro -M:jolt with the arguments given (a script path, -e ...), under build/tools/jolt-env.sh (Lane B: --target chez|gambit; a fail-closed identity preflight child runs first, then the arguments pass through unchanged)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"-cp\" \"src/dev\"\n                         \"src/dev/jolt_target_run.clj\" \"--\"\n                         *command-line-args*)))}\n\n  smoke:jolt-target\n  {:doc \"Lane B target-aware launcher smoke: run a trivial child under the requested host scheme through the jolt-launch seam (--target chez, the default, or --target gambit via JOLT_GAMBIT) and fail closed unless the child itself reports jolt-target: <target> (needs bb bootstrap:jolt; the gambit leg needs the mise-pinned gsi)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"-cp\" \"src/dev\"\n                         \"src/dev/jolt_target_smoke.clj\"\n                         *command-line-args*)))}\n\n  qualify:jolt-libcrypto\n  {:doc \"J1b requalification: print this platform's observed libcrypto identity {:canonical-path :version-num :version :sha256} for jolt-toolchain.edn :native :libcrypto :qualified (the digest from bb and from the library, required equal); changes nothing (needs a built wrapper: bb build:jolt-native, or --requalify after a library change)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"-cp\" \"src/dev\" \"native/jolt-crypto/qualify.clj\")))}\n\n  probe:jolt-crypto\n  {:doc \"J1b: libcrypto provenance (qualified, missing, undeclared, version-floor, wrong-library-first, Linux LD_PRELOAD) and 256 MiB :blocking hash collect-safety, each in a child jolt process (needs bb build:jolt-native; Lane B: --target chez|gambit, fail-closed identity gate, gambit refused — the wrapper protocol is Chez-tier)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"native/jolt-crypto/probes/run.clj\"\n\n  jolt:run\n  {:doc \"Run the bootstrapped jolt with build/tools/jolt-env.sh, passing every argument through (e.g. bb jolt:run -Srepro -M:jolt src/dev/jolt_j0c_workers.clj)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \"sh\" \"-c\"\n                         \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" \\\"$@\\\"\" \"jolt\"\n                         *command-line-args*)))}\n\n  build:yin-repl-node\n  {:doc \"Compile the Node yin.repl (shadow-cljs build :yin-repl) to target/yin-repl.js\"\n   ;; The Node lanes (test:cljs and its variants) depend on this task, so the\n   ;; generated JavaScript parser reaches them through it.\n   :depends [deps:npm gen:antlr]\n   ;; yin.repl.dht-process-test spawns it as the JVM-to-Node reader of\n   ;; DHT epic S5, a required leg: a missing build fails that test.\n   :task (shell \"clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli compile yin-repl\")}\n\n  build:yin-repl-peer\n  {:doc \"Compile the yin.repl R5 cross-host peer (client role and --serve server role) as a Dart exe\"\n   ;; The Dart lanes depend on this task, so the generated Dart parser\n   ;; reaches them through it.\n   :depends [gen:antlr]\n   ;; Process B of the R5 slice is a whole program rather than a test\n   ;; namespace, and this project's cljd.core carries the Flutter extensions,\n   ;; so only an ahead-of-time build is a peer the plain Dart VM can start.\n   ;; It is compiled alone and first: the test build rewrites the same\n   ;; cljd-out tree, so a peer built after it would import a tree it does\n   ;; not match.  The R5 cross-host tests spawn this one exe from the JVM\n   ;; and Node lanes, so `bb test` builds it first; a bare `bb test:clj` or\n   ;; `bb test:cljs` without it skips those tests with a printed notice\n   ;; rather than failing.\n   :task (do (shell \"mkdir -p build\")\n             (shell \"clojure -M:clojuredart:cljd compile yin.repl.slice-peer\")\n             (shell \"dart compile exe lib/cljd-out/yin/repl/slice-peer.dart -o build/yin-repl-peer\"))}\n\n  build:demo\n  {:doc \"Release-compile the browser demo (shadow-cljs build :demo) to public/js/main.js\"\n[tools]\njava = [\"21\", \"17\"]\ncljstyle = \"0.17.642\"\nzprint = \"1.3.0\"\nbabashka = \"1.13.225\"\nclojure = \"1.12.4.1602\"\nnode = \"25.6.1\"\n# jolt host lane (jolt-toolchain.edn): exact pins, never \"latest\"; a change of\n# either goes through the jolt upgrade gate\nchezscheme = \"10.4.1\"\n# gambit is not in mise's registry; the asdf plugin joeljuca/asdf-gambit builds\n# the v4.9.8 tag from source (pre-generated C in the tag archive, so no\n# gambit bootstrap step) — the same from-source 4.9.8 jolt's CI gates target\n# (Makefile GAMBIT_PREFIX comment; tests.yml). Plugin pinned to its full HEAD\n# SHA (mise rejects abbreviated ones). Never \"latest\".\n# Known divergence (review 1794970000000 P2-1): the plugin configures with\n# --enable-single-host only; jolt CI (tests.yml) additionally passes\n# --enable-default-runtime-options=f8,-8,t8. Gates pass with the plugin build;\n# revisit at the upgrade gate if a gate ever disagrees.\n# Fresh installs run a ~15-20 min from-source build including the plugin's\n# `make check` (review P2-2); Linux verified once before this pin landed.\n# [plugins] must stay the LAST table in this file — a mid-file table broke\n# mise's validation of the flutter entry (engineer findings 1794934400000).\ngambit = \"4.9.8\"\ncmake = \"4.4.4\"\nandroid-sdk = \"latest\"\nflutter = { version = \"3.47.8\", platforms = \"\"\"\n[linux-x64]\nurl = \"https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/beta/linux/flutter_linux_{{ version }}-beta.tar.xz\"\n\n[macos-arm64]\nurl = \"https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/beta/macos/flutter_macos_arm64_{{ version }}-beta.zip\"\n\n[macos-x64]\nurl = \"https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/beta/macos/flutter_macos_{{ version }}-beta.zip\"\n\n[windows-x64]\nurl = \"https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/beta/windows/flutter_windows_{{ version }}-beta.zip\"\n\"\"\", version_json_path = \".releases[?channel=beta].version\", version_list_url = \"https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/releases_macos.json\" }\n\n[env._]\npath = [\n  \"{{env.HOME}}/.local/share/mise/installs/android-sdk/1.0/platform-tools\",\n  \"{{env.HOME}}/.local/share/mise/installs/android-sdk/1.0/emulator\",\n]\n\n[env]\n#FLUTTER_STORAGE_BASE_URL = \"https://storage.flutter-io.cn\"\n#PUB_HOSTED_URL = \"https://pub.flutter-io.cn\"\n\n[plugins]\ngambit = \"https://github.com/joeljuca/asdf-gambit#b8a901e7af845c8b0a0ee1adc5b67687ba4c582b\"\n15:   * build/tools/jolt-env.sh is written with JOLT_CHEZ and JOLT_GAMBIT set\n22:     Test seam: JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DEBIAN_INSTALLED=pkg,pkg,... treats the\n34:(defn- fail!\n41:(defn- sh\n53:(defn- mise-bin\n64:(defn- check-chez\n75:(defn- check-gambit\n80:   jolt Gambit gates (Makefile GAMBIT_PREFIX targets) are part of the lane —\n81:   bootstrapping without it would silently leave JOLT_GAMBIT unset.\"\n93:(defn- check-cmake\n103:(defn- submodule-shas\n119:(defn- materialize!\n129:(defn- verify!\n151:(defn- patch-fail!\n156:(defn- sha256\n168:(defn- platform\n176:(defn- check-digests!\n183:(defn- smoke!\n208:(defn- apply-patches!\n235:    (let [skip-requested? (= \"1\" (System/getenv \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_NO_APPLY\"))\n236:          test-dir (System/getenv \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR\")\n239:                (println \"WARNING: JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_NO_APPLY ignored without JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR\")))\n310:(defn- debian-family?\n324:(defn- dpkg-installed?\n331:(defn- check-os-packages\n334:  (let [seam (System/getenv \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DEBIAN_INSTALLED\")\n355:(defn -main\n362:        dir (str (fs/absolutize (or (System/getenv \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR\") (:dir jolt))))\n364:        env-file (str (fs/path (fs/parent dir) \"jolt-env.sh\"))]\n371:                 \"export JOLT_GAMBIT='\" gsi \"'\\n\"\n377:(defn- test-negative!\n380:        source (or (System/getenv \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR\") (get-in toolchain [:jolt :dir]))\n418:                          :extra-env {\"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR\" clone\n419:                                      \"JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_NO_APPLY\" no-apply}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
